msgstr ""
"Restore the journal from a verified backup outside TxnCount, then reload "
"and review. No automatic restoration was attempted."

#. Stable TxnCount key: ui.recovery_help; do not translate this identifier.
msgid "ui.recovery_help"
msgstr ""
"Cancel to preserve everything. Pause Dropbox/Dropsync and inspect the "
"journal and backups before deciding. To restore a backup, first preserve "
"the current journal externally, restore the verified copy, then Reload "
"and review again. Keeping this version does not replay the transaction: "
"it preserves a new snapshot and the old recovery record, then allows "
"editing. A valid journal can still be missing transactions. An unverified"
" backup must not be assumed safe."

