msgid "ui.crud_account_help"
msgstr ""
"Technical ID and currency cannot change. Accounts with history (including"
" an opening entry) can only be deactivated. Lower opening balances must "
"still cover all expenses."

#. Stable TxnCount key: ui.crud_category_help; do not translate this
#. identifier.
msgid "ui.crud_category_help"
msgstr ""
"Technical ID cannot change. Categories with history or children cannot be"
" deleted. Deactivating a parent also hides its descendants from new "
"expenses."

#. Stable TxnCount key: ui.crud_transaction_readonly; do not translate this
#. identifier.
msgid "ui.crud_transaction_readonly"
msgstr ""
"Only TxnCount two-posting expenses with persistent IDs can be edited or "
"deleted here. Change opening balances in Accounts. Split and external "
"entries remain read-only."

#. Stable TxnCount key: ui.crud_inactive; do not translate this identifier.
msgid "ui.crud_inactive"
msgstr ""
"Reactivate the account/category (and its parents) before using it for an "
"expense."

